OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,FSouth East Water staff have been
OL,7,Fthreatened and their vehicles
OL,8,Fattacked, the company says.
OL,10,FThe supplier, which recently had
OL,11,Fanother outage in Kent, says its teams
OL,12,Fhave been working hard to restore
OL,13,Fsupplies and deliver bottled water to
OL,14,Fcustomers, and abuse will not be
OL,15,Ftolerated.
OL,17,FA spokesperson said the company
OL,18,Funderstands the frustrations of
OL,19,Fcustomers and is aware of the
OL,20,Fdisruption its 'persistent issues'
OL,21,Fcause.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
