OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787050071
OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,FSouth East Water also confirmed this
OL,7,Fmorning (Tuesday 18 August) that
OL,8,Fcustomers in Herne Bay may lose water
OL,9,Fsupplies later, due to high demand.
OL,11,FUp to 400 properties in the Benenden,
OL,12,FCranbrook and Rolvenden areas of the
OL,13,Fcounty are also continuing to
OL,14,Fexperience low pressure or no water.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
