PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787050071
OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,FSouth East Water's Head of Health and
OL,7,FSafety, Mike Pickard, said: "We
OL,8,Fcompletely understand how frustrating
OL,9,Fand upsetting it is to be without
OL,10,Fwater, particularly when people are
OL,11,Ftrying to look after their families,
OL,12,Fgo to work and carry on with their
OL,13,Fdaily lives.
OL,15,F"We apologise unreservedly for the
OL,16,Fpersistent issues and disruption this
OL,17,Fongoing situation continues to cause
OL,18,Four customers.
OL,26,@oD@]OUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
