OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787050071
OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,F"Our teams are out there because they
OL,7,Fwant to help. They are working in
OL,8,Fextremely challenging circumstances to
OL,9,Frestore supplies, deliver alternative
OL,10,Fwater and support our customers.
OL,12,F"Being angry about the situation is
OL,13,Funderstandable, but attacking a
OL,14,Fvehicle, threatening a member of staff
OL,15,For subjecting our teams to abuse is
OL,16,Fnot acceptable.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787050071
OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,F"No one should face threats,
OL,7,Fintimidation or violence simply for
OL,8,Fdoing their job, our people are not
OL,9,Fresponsible for the disruption. They
OL,10,Fare the people working to resolve it.
OL,12,F"Most importantly, if our teams feel
OL,13,Funsafe, they may have no choice but to
OL,14,Fleave an area. This can delay the work
OL,15,Fthey are there to carry out and
OL,16,Fultimately delay support reaching the
OL,17,Fvery customers who need it.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1787050071
OL,3,CSouth East Water appeals for 'respect'
OL,4,Ctowards staff after reports of attacks
OL,6,F"We are asking everyone to please give
OL,7,Four teams the space and respect they
OL,8,Fneed to do their jobs safely. If you
OL,9,Fare frustrated or unhappy with the
OL,10,Fsituation, please tell us, we want to
OL,11,Fhear from you and understand your
OL,12,Fconcerns, but please direct that
OL,13,Ffrustration towards the company
OL,14,Fthrough the appropriate channels,
OL,15,Frather than towards our frontline
OL,16,Fcolleagues."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
